# Keep host artifacts out of every Docker build context.
#
# Native addons (better-sqlite3, sodium-native, etc.) are compiled for the
# host arch — copying them into a Linux image causes "invalid ELF header"
# at runtime. Excluding node_modules forces the in-container `pnpm install`
# to compile against the image's libc/arch.

# Dependencies — re-installed inside the image
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Build outputs — re-built inside the image
dist
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local-only state
data
docker/data
docker/backups
**/coverage
*.log
logs/

# Secrets & configs that should never reach an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# IDE / OS
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Docs and meta — saves a few seconds and keeps the layer cache hot
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
docs
